    "site_desc": "This site is located in Boulder, Wyoming, in a high-altitude grassland ecosystem. The region experiences cold winters and mild summers, with relatively low precipitation throughout the year. Snowfall is common during the winter months, contributing to the seasonal water availability. The landscape is primarily covered by grass vegetation, with some areas supported by a center pivot irrigation system, which helps sustain plant growth in the dry environment.",
